      {
        "id": 171860,
        "name": "seesome",
        "username": "seesome",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-15T17:48:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Kickstarter campaign will be to fund the development of Season 2, and the \"regular\" pledge will be a copy of Season Pass 2. After the campaign Kickstarter funds, it will also be for sale just like Season Pass 1 is.&nbsp;If the campaign doesn't fund… we'll have to figure it out. It would be best if you all make sure it does =)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>MigrantP, can you clarify how this will work.&nbsp; I thought that Apple doesn't let folks give out upgrade codes or the like through platforms like Kickstarter.&nbsp; I'm happy to pledge to you guys, but I'm curious how the content will filter down to iOS?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
