      {
        "id": 171861,
        "name": "MigrantP",
        "username": "MigrantP",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-15T18:46:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>The #ScrollGate issue has been a priority for us and we are&nbsp;<span>and we've been able to solve the problem. We're submitting an update to Apple right now and hopefully it will be available to you soon.</span>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>In the meantime, we have created a small web page that you can open on your iPad and use to set up and launch a game. Here is the link:</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>http://sentinelsdigital.com/scrollgate</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Thanks for your patience as we resolve this problem!</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
