        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"seesome\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/48/2018_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> seesome:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>MigrantP, can you clarify how this will work.&nbsp; I thought that Apple doesn't let folks give out upgrade codes or the like through platforms like Kickstarter.&nbsp; I'm happy to pledge to you guys, but I'm curious how the content will filter down to iOS?&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You're right, and we have figured out a way that we hope will make things accessible to players on iOS and Android. It will all be clear on Monday =)</p>",
